{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "73c3c42dbc796116ccb5064fee2b21bd06bdf06dd287409482fa8d79f7b936f5", "ja": "全てを知り得たもの", "zh": "知晓一切之人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8aeda7ff6d2c27405a6c3393228934eafe7fc0ddd9bdb52542608c09d7722e01", "ja": "神の事を知りたい深淵海は、逢路蘭に神の\n望みを聞く。逢路蘭は「儀式は凛音亞では\n都合が悪い」と答える。深淵海は村長の\n馬車に細工をして谷底へと落とし、更に、\n村長が隠していた秘密を永混に告げる。", "zh": "渴望了解神明之事的深渊海，向逢路兰询问神明的心愿。逢路兰回答说\"仪式在凛音亚进行不太方便\"。深渊海对村长的马车动了手脚，使其坠入谷底，更将村长所隐藏的秘密告知了永混。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "900e873f016cb0692e2a72bbb269932dbb3e9c5f5bb134ee9a41e480d6935647", "ja": "やはり、あの時と少しも変わっていない。\nここに何か秘密があるのだろうか……？", "zh": "果然，跟那个时候相比一点都没变。\n这里面难道藏着什么秘密吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "08c1425c089ab56529c7242ab81cd94586c38479f77feec148f9f7c0a026efc3", "ja": "……。\n何をしているの？", "zh": "……。\n你在做什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "c2d6ecbba9312e63dddd8daafdbef2989bff661b5aca744de5fccd0c216adcc2", "ja": "ああ……！　来てくれると思っていたよ。\nもう一度質問させてくれ。君は、あの時の子だね？", "zh": "啊……！我就知道你会来的。\n再让我问一次。你就是那时候的孩子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "7acf92aee333edb897325bfad16b5ed913fa3594e347275991f42d9d930db0f5", "ja": "キミも、ジャマするつもりなの？", "zh": "你也打算来妨碍我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "0a0534b50dfb858bf7072b025266044201a4323a69147cce5464951fa368022a", "ja": "とんでもない。寧ろ私は、もっとよく知りたいんだ。\nこの村にいるという、『神』の事を。", "zh": "当然不是。正相反，我想进一步了解。\n关于据说存在于这个村子里的“神”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "8f0490335151340859353bc99c01d029f980a1f5499ddb0ae37190302ec7c042", "ja": "私は村長のように、君達の神を裏切ったりしない。\nだから協力させてほしい……そうだ！", "zh": "我不会像村长那样背叛你们的神。所以，请让我助你们一臂之力……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "0529b1ab4a53394138e71c28c5e8295c52e6c2ffe65d2a506cb3da4db80e873c", "ja": "君達は、その神に近い存在なんだろう？\nどうすれば、神は喜ぶんだ？　頼む、教えてくれ！", "zh": "你们和那位神明很亲近吧？\n怎么做神才会高兴？拜托了，请告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "5524fb0fcdd686954702340fc41d67911cfdd741c0f245cd8aac6a435e7061ef", "ja": "……言ったところで、\nどうにもならないとは思うけど。", "zh": "……就算说出来，\n我觉得也无济于事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "56271654975ec60a1951fda182770924973980e89e7dcad4806ba0ea99848bd4", "ja": "次の『神降ろし』、面倒なことになりそうでさ。\n村長が厄介で……凛音亞だと、少し都合が悪い。", "zh": "下一次的『神降ろし』，感觉要变得麻烦了。村长很棘手……要是凛音亞的话，会有点不方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "090b2e53b12ca3c4ecdc55fa5bf4716c226d46fc26bdaf173459cba2feb99bf9", "ja": "わかった。上手くいくかどうかは\nわからないが、協力しよう。", "zh": "我知道了。虽然不知道顺不顺利，\n但我会协助你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "3ff1b6122b1db4cf0e48cace4afc8a02fa4c036cca07f7e09305dfcff407d42e", "ja": "どうやって？", "zh": "怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "fbca96b4cb92ba49092a910ec5d7094969d09e1deb23c519abc71453c77fddf5", "ja": "ここは峻険な山の中、悪路も多い。『もし』馬車の\n手入れが少し悪かったら……あっという間に谷底さ。", "zh": "这里可是险峻的山里，到处都是难走的路。要是马车的保养稍微差一点……转眼间就会掉进谷底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "4e2bdba6ba892ac3e4d4e085291fdef8c2bcffbb7a4dd4602d4185707157962e", "ja": "……。\nキミは、どうしてそこまでするの？", "zh": "……\n你为什么要做到这种地步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "eff88aa4591f1aa1b5b5c95fccdf9f72934edfbadd813597e5993796c5c9ca4d", "ja": "言っただろう。私は学者なんだ。\n私はただ、神の事を知りたい。それだけだよ。", "zh": "我说过了。我是个学者。我只是想了解神的事情，仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "e846ede075a3e81673cb78610832f2bb31c1c6566a1b13b0b4bbb98b4c2fe8bf", "ja": "そして私はすべてを知り、村長は……死んだ。", "zh": "然后，我知晓了一切，而村长……死了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1015_sonchonotegami", "source_sha256": "a69ad37ccdf6b1f7391f4d0831590d52268cd80a08a69ac6c7b592f2f6086078", "ja": "「私が志半ばで死んだら、娘にすべてを伝えて欲しい。\n夜羽那は元々大人しく、気の優しい性格の娘だ」", "zh": "“要是我壮志未酬身先死，希望你能把一切都告诉我的女儿。\n夜羽那本来是个文静又心地善良的姑娘”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1016_sonchonotegami", "source_sha256": "52d8a037d151018bd7fdc1162d7017d55708906c374b12b1558b4ea20419650a", "ja": "「身代わりにする凛音亞への後ろめたさ、神への\n恐怖心、跡継ぎとして尊大に振る舞っているだけ……」", "zh": "对被自己当作替身的凛音亚感到的内疚、对神明的恐惧，以及只是在以继承人的身份傲慢行事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1017_sonchonotegami", "source_sha256": "0a11c947524f51628983911f15f61d2aa96d869c61f77ae07d2a74737bc0f5a0", "ja": "「理不尽な神との契約さえなくなれば、きっと\n姉妹揃って、幸せな人生を歩めるはず。どうか……」", "zh": "「只要解除与那蛮不讲理的神的契约，\n姐妹俩就一定能一起走向幸福的人生。求求你……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "65ed46c8a79fb986fa50f961646932b1d991aaa8836f2676b8caa7e618c57f15", "ja": "娘への親心、か。実にわかりやすい……。", "zh": "对女儿的父母心吗。真是好懂……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "ba4a5411f942eedfb805e79fa0f065b76c7cf02290fedcf18b12e0e47cc9fe79", "ja": "真実を伝えれば、恐らくは正しく繰り返される。\nそれは何度も見てきた事なんだ。彼らにとっても。", "zh": "若是传达了真相，恐怕又会如出一辙地再次重演。\n这种事我已经见过好多次了。对他们而言也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "56281023aa512a123e088c97b07cb75dbd4349ad6c214aa0e7862af6ee62d11e", "ja": "では……。", "zh": "那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "0d5947a2088bd2ac649db8faeec7105c18e0f011c340d0066557dbec2c36a99d", "ja": "それじゃ、逢路蘭とお屋敷にいってくるわ。\n永混、みんなと留守番お願いね。", "zh": "那我就和逢路蘭去一趟宅邸。永混，拜托你和大家一起看家啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "c5b29a733a62819c30ee6918b037907371463ee62c40a6a34b33e2a631e53807", "ja": "やあ、君。永混だったね？", "zh": "你好，你是永混吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "69552229b2c748c9cc835eaf6cfbb01522ff36f1fc8c23241dcb181c994943b9", "ja": "貴方は……。", "zh": "您是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "dacfd6495dc736408170a49e2c46a083816aad6ebd623633e978811f76e1b85a", "ja": "私は学者でね、村長の屋敷に招かれているんだ。\n実は、君の耳に入れておきたい事があってね。", "zh": "我是一名学者，受邀住在村长的宅邸。其实，有件事想先告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "7652ae39744411a9cc7ae2c54ab5aecab4c883007145973c4f50d9dc7f77ae25", "ja": "もうすぐこの村で、神降ろしの儀式が行われようと\nしているのは、君も知っているね？", "zh": "这村里马上就要举行降神仪式了，\n这一点你也知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "d6f274292e5993c09fce11e455ec08f5e38d1c080849858f6ddfb78205276580", "ja": "！　……はい……。", "zh": "！……是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_06_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "a3c62b2f11252aa84591bcde7de61bd04029cd087756bfd3d62422b3ee585a13", "ja": "夜羽那お嬢さんは、凛音亞を儀式に指名するだろう。\n実は、彼女達はね……。", "zh": "夜羽那大小姐应该会在仪式上指定凛音亚。\n其实啊，她们俩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
